# Darkness Descends (WotG 37), the whole run, in the Throne Room [S]. The login at Status 0 plays the zone-in 8, left
# open; the update with option 5 sends 05C [1, 23, 1756, 470, 470, 848]; the finish sets Status 1. A Bronze Cap,
# Harness, Mittens, Sword and a Lauan Shield equipped; Status 2 (a GM, for the fight no battlefield file holds): the
# zone-in plays 10; the update with option 5 sends 05C [156, 0, 15, 15, 15, 268, 37] (156, the face 0, then the head,
# body, hands, main and sub models); the finish completes the mission (Adieu, Lilisette current).
lists ThroneRoomS/onZoneIn/1 ThroneRoomS/onEventUpdate/8 ThroneRoomS/onEventUpdate/10 ThroneRoomS/onEventFinish/8 ThroneRoomS/onEventFinish/10
uncovered: 1/-/onEventFinish:32001 -- no battlefield file holds xi.battlefield.id.DARKNESS_DESCENDS (353), so no fight in the Throne Room [S] opens 32001; the finish (Status 2 and the set-down) is pinned by the fake check c3 T7 wotg 37 in tests/XI.Verify.Quests/C3ToauT7.cs
char zone=ThroneRoomS pos=19,0,-4.5 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg DarknessDescends current
item BronzeCap
item BronzeHarness
item BronzeMittens
item BronzeSword
item LauanShield
login open                                 # 8
update 8 option=5                          # the update packet
finish                                     # Status 1
equip BronzeCap Head
equip BronzeHarness Body
equip BronzeMittens Hands
equip BronzeSword Main
equip LauanShield Sub
charvar Mission[5][36]Status 2             # a GM: the fight's win
rezone open                                # 10
update 10 option=5                         # the face and the equipment models
finish                                     # completed
